+# Cloudflare Agents runtime
+
+Static inspection covers only direct generation requests in `AIChatAgent.onChatMessage`. Runtime-spread request tools remain unresolved; `prepareStep` may replace step instructions; and an ordinary function tool that references another agent is not a handoff or routing declaration. Indirect generation, unsupported structured output, and executable fields outside the selected class boundary are not registered agents.
+
+The Worker deployment owner must export each deployed agent class and declare the matching Cloudflare Durable Object binding, add each SQLite-backed class to an append-only `new_sqlite_classes` migration, supply the model provider binding or credentials consumed by the Worker, and deploy the Worker configuration and Durable Object migrations together. Deployment must verify binding names, class exports, environment-specific provider configuration, routes, and migration state; this fixture does not contain that production wiring.
